      "urpx:effectiveDateTime": "2025-07-01T00:00:00",
      "urpx:changeReason": {
        "@id": "urpx:initial"
      },
      "urpx:description": "Palo Alto Green Program modifier on Schedule E-7 (Large Non-Residential Electric Service, demand-metered, >= 1000 kW sustained 3+ months). Applies to E-7 customers participating in the Palo Alto Green Program under the 100% Renewable Option, adding a $0.0075/kWh Palo Alto Green Charge to all energy consumption. Eligibility per Section A of the published Schedule E-7-G: customers who qualify for E-7 Service AND who choose to participate in the Palo Alto Green Program. The 1000 kWh Block Purchase Option ($7.50/block) is also published in the same rate filing but is not modeled here — different metric shape (per-block discrete purchase vs continuous per-kWh consumption); tracked as a follow-up.",
